Herdr Auto Titles

This independent mod bundle contains modified Herdr desktop mods/layouts from
herdrdev/herdr-app 0.1.9 (3e32d75), licensed under Apache-2.0.
Source: https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app
Changes: automatic title policy, manual reset, agent snapshots, standalone
namespaces, custom preview routing, packaging and the Rust installer/CLI/API/MCP runtime.
This project is not an official Herdr release.

